Z||000002||Hank is Here||02-21-2001||12:02 PM||||Jeep DID use the same 4 cyl (151) engine as the Fiero except for the mount points.  In like 85ish they stopped using that engine.  They now use a completly different 150 cid 4 cyl.  The 151 was only used in the CJ7, never in a Wrangler.||||reg||1
